WEBVTT

00:00.800 --> 00:03.790
Don't just tell it. Show it!

00:03.910 --> 00:07.920
Here's a tell. It is cold outside.

00:08.040 --> 00:17.160
Now let's show it. Every tree wore a thick white coat, and my boots left a lonely trail across the frozen hill.

00:17.280 --> 00:21.100
Now you can see it, and almost feel the cold!

00:21.220 --> 00:27.800
Writers have lots of tools. Your senses, similes, metaphors, and more.

00:27.920 --> 00:33.560
On Show ME, you write it, Scribbles checks it, and it joins the gallery!

00:33.680 --> 00:37.622
Now it's your turn! Start showing!
